      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A BRANCH IS MADE, AND THE PROTOTYPE CATCHES UP\n\nThe AI makes a private copy of the prototype repo, just for this.\nNothing in it touches the version that works today.\nIt also fetches client-web's latest finished work first, so the\ndesign is built on what client-web has right now.",
      "originalText": "A BRANCH IS MADE, AND THE PROTOTYPE CATCHES UP\n\nThe AI makes a private copy of the prototype repo, just for this.\nNothing in it touches the version that works today.\nIt also fetches client-web's latest finished work first, so the\ndesign is built on what client-web has right now.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "aFV-xNSJ0w6BPGs6Z0ffV",
