      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2033315264,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why there's a folder called  src/ahead",
      "originalText": "Why there's a folder called  src/ahead",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLB",
      "version": 4942,
      "versionNonce": 1109913152,
      "updated": 1791207875649
    },
    {
      "id": "NXqyYf1vQb8ZesLFiZ7dY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2456.8317345961136,
      "width": 328.7967224121094,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1613641152,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This part is worth showing the developers.",
      "originalText": "This part is worth showing the developers.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLC",
      "version": 4943,
      "versionNonce": 193996352,
      "updated": 1791207875651
    },
    {
      "id": "3PRyYjHWIUsHA6Fx7y_GT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2510.8317345961136,
      "width": 784.871337890625,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 811695552,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The prototype repo is meant to run ahead of what the client-web repo has. That is the point of it.",
      "originalText": "The prototype repo is meant to run ahead of what the client-web repo has. That is the point of it.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLD",
      "version": 4945,
      "versionNonce": 1798397504,
      "updated": 1791207875654
    },
    {
      "id": "0WKT-hdcS-Wplp7K38Ysc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2540.8317345961136,
      "width": 827.6573486328125,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 720094656,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But once a developer builds the same thing in client-web, the same component exists in both repos \u2014",
      "originalText": "But once a developer builds the same thing in client-web, the same component exists in both repos \u2014",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLE",
      "version": 4946,
      "versionNonce": 837523008,
      "updated": 1791207875657
    },
    {
      "id": "6bVKNZebOdXablMpkubQp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2570.8317345961136,
      "width": 463.91363525390625,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1827474880,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "and nobody notices, because nobody was watching for it.",
      "originalText": "and nobody notices, because nobody was watching for it.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLF",
      "version": 4946,
      "versionNonce": 345951808,
      "updated": 1791207875659
    },
    {
      "id": "ggNKj-UPGwofEv0XZ7ihk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2620.8317345961136,
      "width": 774.2684936523438,
      "height": 23.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1871009216,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So:  anything made in the prototype repo that client-web does not have goes in  src/ahead.",
      "originalText": "So:  anything made in the prototype repo that client-web does not have goes in  src/ahead.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLG",
      "version": 4948,
      "versionNonce": 741017152,
      "updated": 1791207875663
    },
    {
      "id": "RBqprUd-td69yrXH1B5l-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2665.8317345961136,
      "width": 716.3794555664062,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 131374528,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022   For the developers, it is the list of what to build next \u2014 already designed, already working.",
      "originalText": "\u2022   For the developers, it is the list of what to build next \u2014 already designed, already working.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLH",
      "version": 4949,
      "versionNonce": 1970290240,
      "updated": 1791207875666
    },
    {
      "id": "CAWtubGCEWtCL2YZbGTBX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2695.8317345961136,
      "width": 672.3155517578125,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1727718848,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022   For the designer, it is what gets checked every time client-web ships something new.",
      "originalText": "\u2022   For the designer, it is what gets checked every time client-web ships something new.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLI",
      "version": 4950,
      "versionNonce": 1364096576,
      "updated": 1791207875668
    },
    {
      "id": "8udurV4KcbiASsPJg4liD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12730.301106665735,
      "y": 2725.8317345961136,
      "width": 701.844482421875,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 437792192,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022   Once client-web has it, the prototype's copy is removed and client-web's is used instead.",
      "originalText": "\u2022   Once client-web has it, the prototype's copy is removed and client-web's is used instead.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLJ",
      "version": 4951,
      "versionNonce": 77966912,
      "updated": 1791207875671
