    },
    {
      "id": "ESBQeEiwwXViPbO_LPDli",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12765.224119961847,
      "y": 3537.2211998206685,
      "width": 259.90374755859375,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 472575424,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHEN DOES SOMETHING GO IN?\n\nTwo kinds of thing:\n\n\u2022  something new that client-web\n    does not have\n\u2022  a changed version of a client-web\n    component \u2014 the crd folder is\n    read-only, so the changed one\n    has to live here\n\nNot a one-off screen or a quick try.",
      "originalText": "WHEN DOES SOMETHING GO IN?\n\nTwo kinds of thing:\n\n\u2022  something new that client-web\n    does not have\n\u2022  a changed version of a client-web\n    component \u2014 the crd folder is\n    read-only, so the changed one\n    has to live here\n\nNot a one-off screen or a quick try.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "QejscdBL4yfj2Zg9raiAI",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLd",
      "version": 4971,
      "versionNonce": 406326848,
      "updated": 1791207875729
    },
    {
      "id": "UuVq8iSGM0i1GcnAAYePJ",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -12240.224119961847,
      "y": 3512.2211998206685,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 290,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 130610624,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "RUSDRf2J-qo5Q9BZv1KYg",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bLe",
      "version": 4971,
      "versionNonce": 1788626496,
      "updated": 1791207875731
    },
    {
      "id": "RUSDRf2J-qo5Q9BZv1KYg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12235.224119961847,
      "y": 3537.2211998206685,
      "width": 217.43978881835938,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 689601984,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHEN IS IT CLEARED?\n\nWhen a developer builds it in\nclient-web.\n\nEvery catch-up checks this list\nagainst what client-web has\nshipped, and says so out loud.\n\nIt only reports. Removing the\nprototype's copy is a job the\ndesigner says yes to.",
      "originalText": "WHEN IS IT CLEARED?\n\nWhen a developer builds it in\nclient-web.\n\nEvery catch-up checks this list\nagainst what client-web has\nshipped, and says so out loud.\n\nIt only reports. Removing the\nprototype's copy is a job the\ndesigner says yes to.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "UuVq8iSGM0i1GcnAAYePJ",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLf",
      "version": 4973,
      "versionNonce": 1404665408,
      "updated": 1791207875734
    },
    {
      "id": "1MZpgHnOeWjwEvgG7Fmy2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -11710.224119961847,
      "y": 3512.2211998206685,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 290,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#99e9f2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 379862464,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Nai80Vn1wYk98xFbOk-Re",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bLg",
      "version": 4973,
      "versionNonce": 342865472,
      "updated": 1791207875737
    },
    {
      "id": "Nai80Vn1wYk98xFbOk-Re",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11705.224119961847,
      "y": 3557.2211998206685,
      "width": 225.75982666015625,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1264979392,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY IT'S A BRIDGE\n\nThe only place where what the\ndesigner made and what the\ndevelopers build next are the\nsame list.\n\nWithout it both repos grow the\nsame component, and neither\nside knows.",
      "originalText": "WHY IT'S A BRIDGE\n\nThe only place where what the\ndesigner made and what the\ndevelopers build next are the\nsame list.\n\nWithout it both repos grow the\nsame component, and neither\nside knows.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "1MZpgHnOeWjwEvgG7Fmy2",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLh",
      "version": 4975,
      "versionNonce": 1369370176,
      "updated": 1791207875740
    },
    {
      "id": "VJWwJZc5nevPVVBFM263O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12770.224119961847,
      "y": 3832.2211998206685,
      "width": 911.1654663085938,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 987137472,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nothing is lost if client-web never builds it. It stays on the list \u2014 a standing request, not a backlog item that goes stale.",
      "originalText": "Nothing is lost if client-web never builds it. It stays on the list \u2014 a standing request, not a backlog item that goes stale.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bLi",
      "version": 4977,
      "versionNonce": 338110016,
      "updated": 1791207875743
    },
